{"id":"28287ff9da7cda0e","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-regrecog.md","title":"Prime-support permutation criterion for regularity","display":"thm-regrecog — Prime-support permutation criterion for regularity","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-regrecog","aliases":["27-thm-regrecog"],"display":"thm-regrecog — Prime-support permutation criterion for regularity","depends_on":["[[27-df-regular]]","[[27-df-minmaxsupport]]","[[27-thm-strengthpreorder]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-regrecog"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-regrecog</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-regrecog — Prime-support permutation criterion for regularity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" href=\"?note=6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" title=\"27-df-regular\">27-df-regular</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a38b86e606184c7f\" href=\"?note=a38b86e606184c7f\" title=\"27-df-minmaxsupport\">27-df-minmaxsupport</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e16c082a622ccd3\" href=\"?note=2e16c082a622ccd3\" title=\"27-thm-strengthpreorder\">27-thm-strengthpreorder</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n],S_n,\\succeq_f,\\mathrm{Regular}_n,\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\([n],S_n,\\succeq_f,\\mathrm{Regular}_n,\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" href=\"?note=6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" title=\"27-df-regular\">27-df-regular</a>，强度预序性质见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e16c082a622ccd3\" href=\"?note=2e16c082a622ccd3\" title=\"27-thm-strengthpreorder\">27-thm-strengthpreorder</a>。</li>\n<li>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M(f)\">\\(\\mathcal M(f)\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a38b86e606184c7f\" href=\"?note=a38b86e606184c7f\" title=\"27-df-minmaxsupport\">27-df-minmaxsupport</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\land\\exists\\pi\\in S_n\\;\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;\\left(r&lt;s\\longrightarrow\\pi(r)\\succeq_f\\pi(s)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\land\\exists\\pi\\in S_n\\;\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;\\left(r&lt;s\\longrightarrow\\pi(r)\\succeq_f\\pi(s)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\left[f\\in\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in S_n\\;\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\;\\left(\\left[r&lt;s\\land\\pi(s)\\in A\\land\\pi(r)\\notin A\\right]\\longrightarrow\\exists P\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\;\\left[P\\subseteq(A\\cup\\{\\pi(r)\\})\\setminus\\{\\pi(s)\\}\\right]\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\left[f\\in\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in S_n\\;\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\;\\left(\\left[r&lt;s\\land\\pi(s)\\in A\\land\\pi(r)\\notin A\\right]\\longrightarrow\\exists P\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\;\\left[P\\subseteq(A\\cup\\{\\pi(r)\\})\\setminus\\{\\pi(s)\\}\\right]\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>第一式是有限完全预序可线性排列的本地推导。第二式依据原书 §8.2，Theorem 8.6(a),(c)，印刷 p.356／PDF p.380；已核对陈述与其引用的 Theorem 8.5 证明。</li>\n<li>对正函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\succeq_f j\">\\(i\\succeq_f j\\)</span> 恰好要求每个包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 而不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 的极小真支持，用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 后仍含有某个极小真支持。该判据可直接在完整正 DNF 的支持族上检查；这里不附加未声明机器模型的复杂性结论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"6ae49270bb9c0b4f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-regular]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-minmaxsupport","status":"resolved","id":"a38b86e606184c7f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-minmaxsupport]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-strengthpreorder","status":"resolved","id":"2e16c082a622ccd3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-strengthpreorder]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"6ae49270bb9c0b4f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$[n],S_n,\\succeq_f,\\mathrm{Regular}_n,\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 见 [[27-df-regular]]，强度预序性质见 [[27-thm-strengthpreorder]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-strengthpreorder","status":"resolved","id":"2e16c082a622ccd3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$[n],S_n,\\succeq_f,\\mathrm{Regular}_n,\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 见 [[27-df-regular]]，强度预序性质见 [[27-thm-strengthpreorder]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-minmaxsupport","status":"resolved","id":"a38b86e606184c7f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"当 $f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 时，$\\mathcal M(f)$ 来自 [[27-df-minmaxsupport]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"[n],S_n,\\succeq_f,\\mathrm{Regular}_n,\\mathrm{Monotone}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\land\\exists\\pi\\in S_n\\;\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;\\left(r<s\\longrightarrow\\pi(r)\\succeq_f\\pi(s)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\left[f\\in\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in S_n\\;\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\;\\left(\\left[r<s\\land\\pi(s)\\in A\\land\\pi(r)\\notin A\\right]\\longrightarrow\\exists P\\in\\mathcal M(f)\\;\\left[P\\subseteq(A\\cup\\{\\pi(r)\\})\\setminus\\{\\pi(s)\\}\\right]\\right)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"i\\succeq_f j","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false}],"bytes":1694,"backlinks":[{"id":"6ae49270bb9c0b4f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"用两个完整 $n$ 维点定义交换比较，明确处理 $i=j$，避免 $n=0,1$ 时出现 $\\mathbb B^{n-2}$。从强到弱的排列是 $\\pi(1)\\succeq_f\\cdots\\succeq_f\\pi(n)$；排列存在性由 [[27-thm-regrecog]] 给出。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-547","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-regrecog|thm-regrecog — Prime-support permutation criterion for regularity]]"}],"outgoing":["6ae49270bb9c0b4f","a38b86e606184c7f","2e16c082a622ccd3"]}